1
00:00:56,273 --> 00:01:02,560
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:02,732 --> 00:01:05,536
(Episode 18)

3
00:01:06,208 --> 00:01:09,337
Li Chong, the former Crown Prince, was put to death for plotting rebellion.

4
00:01:09,548 --> 00:01:11,684
The Crown Prince is the backbone of the nation.

5
00:01:11,834 --> 00:01:13,268
Li Qin, the Seventh Prince,

6
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,602
is compassionate, dutiful, and clever.

7
00:01:14,683 --> 00:01:16,228
He is fully capable of inheriting the throne.

8
00:01:16,339 --> 00:01:18,493
He is hereby named Crown Prince.

9
00:01:18,611 --> 00:01:19,824
He will take charge of the Eastern Palace

10
00:01:19,905 --> 00:01:21,841
and oversee all affairs of the Eastern Palace.

11
00:01:21,922 --> 00:01:23,154
He will participate in government affairs,

12
00:01:23,306 --> 00:01:25,946
all important military and state matters, court...

13
00:01:26,027 --> 00:01:28,398
I have a petition to submit.

14
00:01:36,321 --> 00:01:38,560
We all submit our petition together.

15
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:43,788
Minister Zheng, what are you trying to do?

16
00:01:43,875 --> 00:01:46,560
His Majesty's appointment of the Crown Prince should not be interrupted.

17
00:01:47,267 --> 00:01:48,506
Your Highness, please judge wisely.

18
00:01:48,634 --> 00:01:49,835
Naming the Crown Prince is vital.

19
00:01:49,916 --> 00:01:51,546
We would never dare to stand in the way.

20
00:01:51,851 --> 00:01:55,120
But right now, everyone, from court to commoners, is anxious

21
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:58,049
because Shen Xiao, a civil official, acted without imperial orders

22
00:01:58,149 --> 00:02:00,948
and privately transferred command without the token.

23
00:02:01,042 --> 00:02:02,878
He deployed Shence troops into the palace without approval.

24
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,055
This is suspected treason. He deserves the death penalty.

25
00:02:05,142 --> 00:02:07,639
If Shen Xiao is spared, the law loses its authority.

26
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,538
Desperate times call for desperate measures.

27
00:02:10,668 --> 00:02:12,201
He did protect the king loyally.

28
00:02:12,588 --> 00:02:14,719
When I rule the nation as Crown Prince,

29
00:02:14,962 --> 00:02:16,574
I promise to handle it myself.

30
00:02:17,083 --> 00:02:18,243
Your Highness, please think it over.

31
00:02:18,363 --> 00:02:19,736
Merit and mistakes are separate.

32
00:02:19,868 --> 00:02:23,059
Today he moved Shence Camp troops without permission to protect the king,

33
00:02:23,272 --> 00:02:26,061
what if he is unhappy tomorrow and deploys troops without permission

34
00:02:26,142 --> 00:02:27,754
to march right into Zichen Hall?

35
00:02:27,908 --> 00:02:30,308
If this arrogance and abuse of power isn't curbed,

36
00:02:30,437 --> 00:02:33,489
what will happen to the law and authority of the kingdom?

37
00:02:33,914 --> 00:02:36,279
We only wish to serve a wise ruler.

38
00:02:36,396 --> 00:02:39,227
We hope Your Highness puts the kingdom above all else.

39
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,547
Don't let small things ruin the greater good

40
00:02:40,628 --> 00:02:42,276
and discourage your loyal ministers.

41
00:02:42,628 --> 00:02:45,081
Otherwise, the Crown Prince

42
00:02:45,429 --> 00:02:47,600
can also be replaced with other talented members of the royal family.

43
00:02:49,788 --> 00:02:51,160
Are you saying

44
00:02:51,287 --> 00:02:55,914
that the noble families will back another royal member as Crown Prince

45
00:02:56,077 --> 00:02:57,530
if Shen Xiao isn't killed?

46
00:02:59,790 --> 00:03:01,682
If Shen Xiao hadn't acted so quickly,

47
00:03:01,893 --> 00:03:04,124
the ones standing here might be traitors instead.

48
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:06,356
Are you really loyal to the court,

49
00:03:06,497 --> 00:03:08,160
or are you plotting something else?

50
00:03:11,598 --> 00:03:13,914
Your Highness, please uphold justice

51
00:03:14,041 --> 00:03:15,386
to secure the foundation of the kingdom.

52
00:03:15,542 --> 00:03:17,908
Your Highness, please uphold justice

53
00:03:18,066 --> 00:03:19,679
to secure the foundation of the kingdom.

54
00:03:33,868 --> 00:03:36,160
I, Shen Xiao,

55
00:03:36,938 --> 00:03:38,320
admit my guilt.

56
00:03:42,467 --> 00:03:44,199
I deployed troops without imperial orders.

57
00:03:44,612 --> 00:03:46,082
I am guilty of a crime punishable by death.

58
00:03:46,254 --> 00:03:48,097
Your Highness, please put the kingdom first

59
00:03:48,347 --> 00:03:51,160
and send me to prison

60
00:03:51,389 --> 00:03:52,800
for execution on a later date.

61
00:04:35,289 --> 00:04:36,842
They really can't stand you.

62
00:04:36,953 --> 00:04:38,440
(Prison of the Ministry of Justice)

63
00:04:45,389 --> 00:04:46,801
I regret it now.

64
00:04:47,379 --> 00:04:49,000
I shouldn't have dragged you into this.

65
00:04:49,525 --> 00:04:51,337
Cui Jin Zhi was right.

66
00:04:52,355 --> 00:04:54,127
I'm the one who ruined you.

67
00:04:54,943 --> 00:04:57,063
I plotted against you and used you.

68
00:04:57,629 --> 00:04:59,841
I made you their biggest threat.

69
00:05:02,498 --> 00:05:03,948
I truly regret it.

70
00:05:08,529 --> 00:05:10,033
Unless I want to,

71
00:05:10,659 --> 00:05:12,122
no one can use me.

72
00:05:14,251 --> 00:05:16,474
Honestly, I knew this day would come.

73
00:05:17,298 --> 00:05:19,271
Even if I had to do it a thousand times,

74
00:05:19,788 --> 00:05:21,601
I'd still make the same choice.

75
00:05:24,428 --> 00:05:27,041
Luckily, everything I set out to do is already done.

76
00:05:27,611 --> 00:05:28,904
I have no regrets and complaints.

77
00:05:39,228 --> 00:05:40,601
But...

78
00:05:43,348 --> 00:05:46,801
There's still one wish I haven't fulfilled at the end.

79
00:05:49,638 --> 00:05:51,050
You have to make it happen for me.

80
00:05:51,613 --> 00:05:52,844
Go on.

81
00:05:55,629 --> 00:05:58,161
Well, at this point,

82
00:05:58,589 --> 00:06:00,640
you really should give me a proper title.

83
00:06:02,583 --> 00:06:04,982
Prince Consort Commander sounds pretty good.

84
00:06:06,750 --> 00:06:09,283
Seriously? You're thinking about that at a time like this?

85
00:06:10,189 --> 00:06:11,721
The Prince Consort title is yours.

86
00:06:12,029 --> 00:06:14,400
- But you'll only be Prince Consort for three days.   - That's all I need.

87
00:06:15,708 --> 00:06:17,360
As long as you promise me,

88
00:06:17,692 --> 00:06:19,745
I'll have no regrets in this life.

89
00:06:21,989 --> 00:06:23,413
Unless you don't want to.

90
00:06:23,918 --> 00:06:25,149
I do.

91
00:06:28,348 --> 00:06:29,579
I do.

92
00:06:38,573 --> 00:06:40,865
Tradition says marriage needs matchmakers and formal gifts.

93
00:06:41,667 --> 00:06:43,751
But right now, we have none of that.

94
00:06:44,458 --> 00:06:45,909
All we have is our hearts,

95
00:06:46,172 --> 00:06:47,403
this hairpin,

96
00:06:47,509 --> 00:06:49,000
and Heaven and Earth as our witness.

97
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:52,952
Will you put it on for me?

98
00:07:33,525 --> 00:07:34,756
Actually,

99
00:07:35,668 --> 00:07:37,041
I have an idea.

100
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,231
You...

101
00:07:49,801 --> 00:07:52,600
I have a plan. But we'll have to take a gamble.

102
00:07:53,389 --> 00:07:55,281
Our breakthrough is the Crown Princess.

103
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:58,200
When the deposed Crown Prince rebelled,

104
00:07:58,375 --> 00:08:00,012
Le Sheng once saved the Crown Princess.

105
00:08:00,263 --> 00:08:02,235
I even asked Le Sheng about it.

106
00:08:02,619 --> 00:08:04,000
Le Sheng said

107
00:08:04,283 --> 00:08:06,495
he had a connection with the Crown Princess.

108
00:08:07,669 --> 00:08:09,281
When he was very young,

109
00:08:09,909 --> 00:08:12,320
the Crown Princess was the only one in the royal family

110
00:08:12,949 --> 00:08:14,921
who ever showed him kindness.

111
00:08:17,909 --> 00:08:19,320
The wise ones of ancient times

112
00:08:19,417 --> 00:08:20,908
often had unusual traits.

113
00:08:22,228 --> 00:08:24,161
You don't seem like a jinx to me.

114
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,067
You seem more like a fallen immortal,

115
00:08:26,227 --> 00:08:27,639
touched by frost and beauty.

116
00:08:31,621 --> 00:08:33,233
This jade pendant is for you.

117
00:08:33,508 --> 00:08:36,161
May it bring you peace and good fortune.

118
00:08:46,042 --> 00:08:48,550
The Crown Princess is from a noble family, but she's also smart.

119
00:08:48,748 --> 00:08:52,480
She knows how to weigh the pros and cons, and make the best decision.

120
00:09:05,417 --> 00:09:09,422
Your Highness invited us to a banquet at the Zheng estate today.

121
00:09:09,875 --> 00:09:12,529
It shows you care about the bigger picture.

122
00:09:12,664 --> 00:09:14,437
I'm truly comforted by that.

123
00:09:14,606 --> 00:09:16,578
A stable kingdom

124
00:09:16,754 --> 00:09:19,407
always relies on rules and order.

125
00:09:20,508 --> 00:09:22,200
Since you invited us,

126
00:09:22,375 --> 00:09:24,461
why hasn't the banquet started yet?

127
00:09:24,662 --> 00:09:25,912
What's the rush?

128
00:09:25,993 --> 00:09:27,605
Not everyone has arrived yet.

129
00:09:28,410 --> 00:09:30,000
Not everyone is here yet?

130
00:09:44,274 --> 00:09:45,505
You...

131
00:09:45,829 --> 00:09:47,329
You're a condemned criminal.

132
00:09:47,410 --> 00:09:49,160
How dare you ruin our banquet?

133
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,708
Duke Ning, that's out of line.

134
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,707
He's our honored guest.

135
00:09:54,381 --> 00:09:55,624
There should be order between ranks

136
00:09:55,748 --> 00:09:57,200
and a clear line between nobles and commoners.

137
00:09:57,375 --> 00:10:00,415
Your Highnesses, are you trying to humiliate

138
00:10:00,496 --> 00:10:02,738
every noble family in the land and us?

139
00:10:02,865 --> 00:10:07,760
It seems like you don't need our support or guidance, Seventh Prince.

140
00:10:07,936 --> 00:10:10,520
This banquet isn't worth attending.

141
00:10:10,748 --> 00:10:13,819
Everyone, let's go.

142
00:10:14,246 --> 00:10:16,067
No need to stay. Let's leave.

143
00:10:16,187 --> 00:10:17,418
Let's leave.

144
00:10:22,509 --> 00:10:24,500
- This...   - All of you...

145
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,160
Seventh Prince, what is the meaning of this?

146
00:10:29,667 --> 00:10:33,120
You are detaining important court officials and noble elders.

147
00:10:33,348 --> 00:10:35,840
Do you realize what crime this is?

148
00:10:41,472 --> 00:10:42,703
Duke Ning.

149
00:10:43,167 --> 00:10:45,259
The noble families have held power for years.

150
00:10:45,458 --> 00:10:47,109
Isn't it time to step back?

151
00:10:51,627 --> 00:10:53,319
You all want me dead

152
00:10:53,512 --> 00:10:55,003
to purge the humble families

153
00:10:55,813 --> 00:10:57,824
and monopolize power in court.

154
00:10:57,948 --> 00:11:00,291
But His Majesty has already secretly ordered the Shence Camp.

155
00:11:00,476 --> 00:11:01,899
If anything happens in the palace,

156
00:11:02,006 --> 00:11:05,040
whether it's the Seventh Prince, Princess Zhao Yang, or me, Shen Xiao,

157
00:11:05,228 --> 00:11:07,761
any of us can command the Shence Camp to protect His Majesty.

158
00:11:07,873 --> 00:11:09,324
After my time in prison,

159
00:11:09,483 --> 00:11:12,520
I've seen just how arrogant the noble families are.

160
00:11:12,938 --> 00:11:16,720
They'll do anything to cut off the humble families' future.

161
00:11:19,348 --> 00:11:21,800
Today, I want you all to know this.

162
00:11:22,485 --> 00:11:24,136
An attempt to kill Shen Xiao

163
00:11:24,267 --> 00:11:26,360
and destroy the hope of every humble family

164
00:11:26,484 --> 00:11:27,975
is impossible.

165
00:11:28,337 --> 00:11:30,110
I invited you all here today

166
00:11:30,406 --> 00:11:32,537
to discuss a way forward.

167
00:11:33,292 --> 00:11:35,144
It's a path for the noble families

168
00:11:35,324 --> 00:11:37,457
and also the path forward for the Ye Dynasty.

169
00:11:40,316 --> 00:11:41,969
I plan to establish the Affairs Hall.

170
00:11:42,542 --> 00:11:43,773
From now on,

171
00:11:43,932 --> 00:11:45,664
all important military and state matters

172
00:11:46,498 --> 00:11:51,087
must be decided by the Affairs Hall before being carried out.

173
00:11:51,491 --> 00:11:52,943
Seats will be set inside the hall.

174
00:11:53,076 --> 00:11:54,609
The ruler sits at the head.

175
00:11:54,795 --> 00:11:57,680
Below that, there'll be three seats for the noble families

176
00:11:58,685 --> 00:12:01,149
and three seats for the humble families.

177
00:12:01,292 --> 00:12:02,523
Absurd.

178
00:12:03,625 --> 00:12:06,243
How can a bunch of peasants and poor scholars

179
00:12:06,333 --> 00:12:09,600
be worthy enough to sit and discuss politics

180
00:12:09,713 --> 00:12:11,685
on equal footing with us?

181
00:12:12,228 --> 00:12:13,459
That's right.

182
00:12:14,581 --> 00:12:16,954
We want equal footing.

183
00:12:17,466 --> 00:12:19,673
You...

184
00:12:20,429 --> 00:12:21,801
You can choose

185
00:12:22,305 --> 00:12:26,554
to sit honorably in the new court or...

186
00:12:27,148 --> 00:12:30,240
I'd rather see my family, the Cui family's

187
00:12:30,458 --> 00:12:33,480
century-old pride shatter than survive in shame.

188
00:12:34,549 --> 00:12:36,200
My family, the Lu family,

189
00:12:36,348 --> 00:12:41,360
has countless clans all tied together in Longxi and Jiangnan.

190
00:12:41,485 --> 00:12:43,456
Can you kill them all?

191
00:12:43,868 --> 00:12:47,720
If you have the guts, kill us all right here.

192
00:13:00,245 --> 00:13:01,840
(Cui Family Record)

193
00:13:05,740 --> 00:13:09,952
The Cui family really has deep roots that have flourished

194
00:13:10,184 --> 00:13:11,682
for a hundred years.

195
00:13:11,820 --> 00:13:13,021
You...

196
00:13:13,143 --> 00:13:16,497
What are you planning to do with our family records?

197
00:13:22,669 --> 00:13:24,859
No! Don't burn it.

198
00:13:30,827 --> 00:13:32,755
Stop...

199
00:13:32,851 --> 00:13:35,102
Stop...

200
00:13:35,892 --> 00:13:37,224
Stop!

201
00:13:39,493 --> 00:13:40,880
Stop!

202
00:13:42,493 --> 00:13:44,080
Don't burn it!

203
00:13:44,292 --> 00:13:45,825
Life is precious.

204
00:13:46,284 --> 00:13:48,457
By burning this record,

205
00:13:49,565 --> 00:13:52,417
I suppose your ancestors watching from above

206
00:13:52,949 --> 00:13:55,641
won't blame their descendants for being unfilial

207
00:13:56,106 --> 00:13:57,543
and breaking the family legacy.

208
00:13:57,645 --> 00:14:01,243
Stop! Please don't do it!

209
00:14:01,388 --> 00:14:06,401
That's our ancestral roots. You can't burn them.

210
00:14:07,833 --> 00:14:09,320
Why not?

211
00:14:09,513 --> 00:14:11,645
You noble families are loaded.

212
00:14:12,211 --> 00:14:15,704
You monopolize resources everywhere but refuse to share with the people.

213
00:14:16,032 --> 00:14:18,484
You leave the masses in misery

214
00:14:18,668 --> 00:14:20,560
with no chance to catch a break.

215
00:14:20,829 --> 00:14:22,194
You seize public land for yourselves

216
00:14:22,315 --> 00:14:23,846
and turn commoners into slaves.

217
00:14:24,579 --> 00:14:26,311
Dynasties may change,

218
00:14:26,498 --> 00:14:28,470
but noble families never fall.

219
00:14:29,292 --> 00:14:31,143
You're nothing but fat rats.

220
00:14:32,565 --> 00:14:34,338
If you don't agree with the new system,

221
00:14:35,129 --> 00:14:38,341
I'll burn each family record in order,

222
00:14:38,812 --> 00:14:42,785
so your so-called noble bloodline and tradition of poetry and virtue

223
00:14:43,136 --> 00:14:47,000
will go up in flames

224
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,920
and turn to ashes tonight.

225
00:14:56,137 --> 00:14:57,368
Gentlemen,

226
00:14:57,542 --> 00:14:59,114
have you thought it through?

227
00:15:07,649 --> 00:15:08,880
Uncles and elders.

228
00:15:09,067 --> 00:15:10,444
When the Yellow River flooded,

229
00:15:10,564 --> 00:15:12,719
Seventh Prince went to the affected places to help the victims

230
00:15:12,875 --> 00:15:14,326
and won the people's hearts.

231
00:15:15,148 --> 00:15:16,480
The people are the foundation.

232
00:15:16,588 --> 00:15:18,800
They can support a ruler, but they can also overthrow him.

233
00:15:19,171 --> 00:15:21,463
You must understand where the people's hearts lie.

234
00:15:23,596 --> 00:15:25,889
Seventh Prince offers all of you a way out.

235
00:15:26,148 --> 00:15:27,623
It'll protect your family name

236
00:15:27,749 --> 00:15:29,320
and shelter your descendants.

237
00:15:35,451 --> 00:15:39,426
I, Zheng Shu, agree to this system and support the new emperor

238
00:15:39,562 --> 00:15:41,014
on behalf of the Zheng family.

239
00:15:42,069 --> 00:15:43,720
The entire Cui family

240
00:15:44,557 --> 00:15:46,729
will follow the new system.

241
00:15:46,842 --> 00:15:50,334
We are willing to follow the new system.

242
00:15:52,509 --> 00:15:54,240
The noble families fall,

243
00:15:54,583 --> 00:15:56,040
and the humble families rise.

244
00:15:56,179 --> 00:15:57,631
But don't forget.

245
00:15:57,854 --> 00:16:01,520
Today's humble families will become the new nobles.

246
00:16:01,708 --> 00:16:03,320
The shift in power

247
00:16:03,511 --> 00:16:06,232
is just the old tree falling and new wood growing.

248
00:16:06,428 --> 00:16:10,091
It's a repeating cycle.

249
00:16:10,828 --> 00:16:13,961
Class shifts are just the way of the world.

250
00:16:14,588 --> 00:16:17,880
Your mistake is thinking your status lasts forever.

251
00:16:18,316 --> 00:16:20,000
You fear new power

252
00:16:20,291 --> 00:16:22,144
and block the path for talent.

253
00:16:22,669 --> 00:16:25,560
That's why the court is stagnant now.

254
00:16:26,034 --> 00:16:28,887
If the humble families block progress someday,

255
00:16:29,068 --> 00:16:32,401
someone else will rise up and overthrow them.

256
00:16:41,516 --> 00:16:42,920
(Everything has been decided.)

257
00:16:43,339 --> 00:16:45,392
(I finally did something right.)

258
00:16:45,709 --> 00:16:48,240
(For the rest of my life, I'll live walking the Buddha's path)

259
00:16:48,613 --> 00:16:50,520
(to atone for my sins)

260
00:16:50,916 --> 00:16:53,009
(and seek true peace.)

261
00:17:20,349 --> 00:17:22,000
Why are you here?

262
00:17:22,885 --> 00:17:24,897
I didn't summon you.

263
00:17:28,228 --> 00:17:30,361
Father, I'm here to tell you

264
00:17:30,548 --> 00:17:33,137
that humble and noble families now share power.

265
00:17:33,405 --> 00:17:35,617
The nobles' monopoly

266
00:17:36,476 --> 00:17:37,981
is finally over.

267
00:17:38,122 --> 00:17:40,134
I've fulfilled your wish

268
00:17:41,392 --> 00:17:42,872
and brought it to an end.

269
00:17:50,748 --> 00:17:52,361
Back then, my mother

270
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:55,072
also coughed,

271
00:17:56,004 --> 00:17:57,520
as you do now.

272
00:17:59,243 --> 00:18:00,474
In the end,

273
00:18:01,892 --> 00:18:04,703
she hanged herself in the Cold Palace with a white silk.

274
00:18:15,267 --> 00:18:16,838
You're my father,

275
00:18:18,349 --> 00:18:20,641
but not a good emperor

276
00:18:21,251 --> 00:18:23,423
and even less a good father.

277
00:18:25,597 --> 00:18:26,888
All these years,

278
00:18:28,875 --> 00:18:31,287
I've wished for your death every day.

279
00:18:34,524 --> 00:18:36,496
But now, I don't feel that way.

280
00:18:39,629 --> 00:18:42,513
Because you're not worth anyone lifting a finger.

281
00:18:43,788 --> 00:18:46,760
You've already suffered the harshest punishment.

282
00:18:49,413 --> 00:18:50,661
Betrayed by all

283
00:18:51,798 --> 00:18:53,129
and abandoned by your family.

284
00:19:53,500 --> 00:20:02,640
(Year 31 of Bingqian Era, Emperor Bingqian passes away)

285
00:20:10,152 --> 00:20:13,417
(Seventh Prince, Li Qin, inherits the throne)

286
00:20:13,498 --> 00:20:17,023
(and changes the era title to Qichang)

287
00:20:38,548 --> 00:20:43,200
Long live the emperor.

288
00:20:45,399 --> 00:20:48,319
By Heaven's mandate and the emperor's decree,

289
00:20:48,530 --> 00:20:52,464
I inherit a grand legacy and am blessed by Heaven.

290
00:20:52,571 --> 00:20:55,785
Princess Zhao Yang, Li Shu, is known for her loyalty and filial piety.

291
00:20:55,875 --> 00:20:57,263
She has served the kingdom well.

292
00:20:57,333 --> 00:20:58,853
Now, by special decree,

293
00:20:58,949 --> 00:21:01,935
she is promoted to Grand Princess of the Realm.

294
00:21:02,042 --> 00:21:04,322
She receives the salary of two princes

295
00:21:04,417 --> 00:21:06,319
and is granted a fief for 8,000 households.

296
00:21:06,448 --> 00:21:08,340
End of decree.

297
00:21:09,358 --> 00:21:10,960
I thank Your Majesty's grace.

298
00:21:34,244 --> 00:21:36,000
(Everything has finally settled.)

299
00:21:36,228 --> 00:21:37,921
(Just like Sister said,)

300
00:21:38,268 --> 00:21:41,601
(she has stayed away from court politics ever since.)

301
00:21:45,330 --> 00:21:46,747
(In the first year of Qichang,)

302
00:21:46,833 --> 00:21:49,968
(the new emperor pushed for land reforms to curb the powerful)

303
00:21:50,143 --> 00:21:52,086
(and opened up official paths for humble families.)

304
00:21:52,167 --> 00:21:54,695
(Within a few years, new scholars began to rise)

305
00:21:54,788 --> 00:21:57,068
(and finally stood alongside noble families in court.)

306
00:21:57,212 --> 00:21:58,463
(They were equals and rivals.)

307
00:21:58,596 --> 00:22:01,567
(Grand Princess Li Shu and Chancellor Shen Xiao)

308
00:22:01,717 --> 00:22:04,002
(opened schools across the provinces.)

309
00:22:04,106 --> 00:22:06,430
(Everyone could attend and learn)

310
00:22:06,548 --> 00:22:08,921
(regardless of background or gender.)

311
00:22:23,319 --> 00:22:25,709
Didn't Your Highness ask me to come and count money?

312
00:22:25,835 --> 00:22:27,886
Why won't you let me in through the front door?

313
00:22:28,956 --> 00:22:31,738
Aren't you obsessed with climbing over walls?

314
00:22:32,430 --> 00:22:34,083
Besides, you're the Chancellor.

315
00:22:34,164 --> 00:22:37,200
Aren't you afraid people will gossip if you visit my residence frequently?

316
00:22:46,417 --> 00:22:51,561
Everyone in court knows I'm Your Highness's male companion.

317
00:22:52,500 --> 00:22:53,952
What's there to hide?

318
00:22:55,708 --> 00:22:57,680
It's still broad daylight.

319
00:22:57,957 --> 00:23:01,008
Why did you show up at my place at this hour?

320
00:23:05,458 --> 00:23:07,511
Today is Qiqiao Festival.

321
00:23:09,402 --> 00:23:11,000
There's a lantern festival in the West Market.

322
00:23:11,238 --> 00:23:13,851
Would Your Highness like to go together?

323
00:23:15,686 --> 00:23:17,287
Who wants to go with you?

324
00:23:17,368 --> 00:23:18,900
Don't bother me, I'm watching sword dancing.

325
00:23:31,068 --> 00:23:33,321
Your Highness is obsessed with sword dancing.

326
00:23:33,621 --> 00:23:35,392
What's so great about these?

327
00:23:36,834 --> 00:23:38,687
I'll give you a real show today.

328
00:23:49,542 --> 00:23:52,040
Censor Shen, you've been eavesdropping for so long.

329
00:23:52,176 --> 00:23:54,120
I doubt you just happened to walk by.

330
00:23:54,268 --> 00:23:55,920
Could it be

331
00:23:56,893 --> 00:23:58,905
that you can't stop thinking about me?

332
00:24:01,848 --> 00:24:03,200
From now on, just use this

333
00:24:03,281 --> 00:24:04,880
to get in and out of my residence.

334
00:24:04,997 --> 00:24:06,374
Who said you could take your clothes off?

335
00:24:06,467 --> 00:24:08,507
- Aren't we sharing a bed?   - It doesn't mean you should undress.

336
00:24:08,590 --> 00:24:10,440
Put your clothes back on. Get in bed. Go to sleep.

337
00:24:12,757 --> 00:24:15,088
What if I'm not content just being a male companion?

338
00:24:17,125 --> 00:24:18,885
Did you not hear what I said?

339
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,958
Just do what you're supposed to and don't bring trouble on yourself.

340
00:24:21,144 --> 00:24:23,516
Like I don't have enough trouble already.

341
00:24:31,325 --> 00:24:32,556
Let him go.

342
00:24:38,045 --> 00:24:39,276
Shen Xiao.

343
00:24:40,038 --> 00:24:41,689
Heaven or hell,

344
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:45,132
I'll be with you no matter what.

345
00:25:03,869 --> 00:25:05,681
Her Highness really has a refined taste.

346
00:25:33,255 --> 00:25:36,024
(May everyone live the kind of life they desire, Que Nu)

347
00:26:09,890 --> 00:26:11,091
Your Highness, you promised

348
00:26:11,189 --> 00:26:13,121
to make me the Prince Consort Commander.

349
00:26:14,502 --> 00:26:17,440
A prince consort has to follow all the rules.

350
00:26:17,739 --> 00:26:19,320
You won't get to be free and have fun

351
00:26:19,539 --> 00:26:21,152
like a male companion.

352
00:26:40,149 --> 00:26:41,653
Let's see how you do.
